## Ensana Hotels — Where Healing Tradition Meets Modern Care

Mariánské Lázně (Marienbad) ranks among Europe's most distinguished spa destinations and has held [UNESCO World Heritage](/en/unesco) status since 2021. In the heart of this town, with over a hundred [mineral springs](/en/mineral-springs) and more than two centuries of [spa history](/en/history), Ensana operates seven properties — from an exclusive five-star flagship to welcoming three-star hotels with their own treatment centres.

Every Ensana hotel in Marienbad offers comprehensive spa programmes under qualified medical supervision. Guests have access to a wide range of balneology treatments — from traditional mineral baths and [CO₂ therapy](/en/co2-therapy) to peat wraps and modern physiotherapy. Each hotel has its own character, but all share the same foundation: time-honoured spa tradition combined with modern medical standards.

## Premium Spa Hotels

### Ensana Nové Lázně

Ensana Nové Lázně (New Bath House) is the flagship of the Ensana network in Marienbad and one of the most impressive spa buildings in Central Europe. The magnificent Neo-Renaissance structure, dating from 1896, houses the legendary Roman Bath — a pool built in the style of antiquity that once welcomed kings and emperors and remains the only one of its kind in Central Europe. The hotel offers 97 spacious rooms and suites that blend historic charm with modern comfort.

The hotel's treatment centre provides more than 60 balneology procedures. Under the supervision of a medical team, guests undergo individually tailored programmes that harness the town's natural healing resources.

- **Roman Bath** — unique pool in the original 1896 interior
- **CO₂ baths** — natural carbonated baths with mineral water from local [springs](/en/springs-overview)
- **Peat wraps** — traditional [peloid therapy](/en/peloid-therapy) with local peat
- **Mineral baths** — individually prescribed following medical examination
- **Comprehensive medical care** — initial examination, ongoing monitoring, home-care recommendations

More about this hotel and booking at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/hotels/nove-lazne?utm_source=marienbad&utm_medium=pillar-page&utm_campaign=hotel-booking)

