### Ensana Centrální Lázně

Ensana Centrální Lázně (Central Bath House) is the most historically significant spa house in Marienbad — its story goes back to 1812, when the first public bathing facility was established here. The Classicist building stands directly on Goethe Square, just steps from the [Main Colonnade](/en/colonnade) and the most important mineral springs. This exceptional location makes it effortless for guests to incorporate a daily drinking cure into their spa programme.

The hotel offers 144 comfortable rooms following a recent renovation, along with a modern wellness centre. A diagnostic centre with full medical facilities is also part of the property.

- **Location** — directly beside the Colonnade and mineral springs
- **Wellness centre** — saunas, relaxation areas and carbonated baths; pool available at partner hotels Hvězda and Nové Lázně
- **Diagnostic centre** — comprehensive medical examination and diagnostics
- **Drinking cure** — springs within walking distance of the hotel entrance

More about this hotel and booking at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/hotels/centralni-lazne?utm_source=marienbad&utm_medium=pillar-page&utm_campaign=hotel-booking)

