### Ensana Hvězda

Ensana Hvězda (Star) is an Art Nouveau gem on Goethe Square. The 1905 building captivates with its ornate façade, spacious rooms with high ceilings and rich stucco decoration. Through an elegant connecting passage, guests have access to the extensive spa facilities of the Hotel Imperial — one of the largest in Marienbad.

The Ensana Hvězda complex comprises three interconnected buildings — Ensana Hvězda, Imperial and Neapol — offering a total of 238 tastefully appointed rooms that combine Art Nouveau charm with modern amenities. The first-rate restaurant offers both dietary and classic menus tailored to each guest's treatment programme.

- **Art Nouveau [architecture](/en/architecture)** — one of the finest Art Nouveau buildings in Marienbad
- **Imperial Spa** — access via connecting passage to the extensive spa facilities
- **238 rooms** — complex of three buildings (Ensana Hvězda, Imperial, Neapol) with high ceilings, original details and modern comfort
- **Restaurant** — dietary and classic menus under the head chef's guidance

More about this hotel and booking at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/hotels/hvezda?utm_source=marienbad&utm_medium=pillar-page&utm_campaign=hotel-booking)

