### Ensana Pacifik

Ensana Pacifik, built in Neo-Baroque style, stands on Mírové Square and offers an elegant setting with views over the spa park and surrounding forests. The 1906 building has its own balneology centre, making it the ideal choice for guests who want all their treatments under one roof. Thanks to its position at the edge of the spa zone, Ensana Pacifik is an excellent starting point for [day trips](/en/day-trips) into the Slavkov Forest and the surrounding [countryside](/en/nature).

- **Own balneology centre** — full treatment spectrum within the hotel
- **Location** — Mírové Square with views of the park and forest
- **Starting point** — ideal for hiking in the Slavkov Forest

More about this hotel and booking at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/hotels/pacifik?utm_source=marienbad&utm_medium=pillar-page&utm_campaign=hotel-booking)

