### Ensana Butterfly

Ensana Butterfly is the newest Ensana hotel in Marienbad. The modern 2003 building on Hlavní třída (Main Street) offers contemporary design and bright, spacious rooms — many of them wheelchair accessible. It is one of two Ensana hotels in Marienbad with a dedicated children's play corner (alongside Ensana Hvězda), making it a natural choice for families.

The two-storey wellness centre includes an indoor pool, sauna world, steam baths and a wide selection of both modern and traditional treatments.

- **Family-friendly** — one of two Ensana hotels with a children's play corner (alongside Ensana Hvězda)
- **Modern design** — bright, spacious rooms with contemporary amenities
- **Wellness centre** — two storeys, indoor pool, saunas, steam baths
- **Accessibility** — numerous rooms adapted for guests with limited mobility

More about this hotel and booking at [ensanahotels.com](https://ensanahotels.com/en/hotels/butterfly?utm_source=marienbad&utm_medium=pillar-page&utm_campaign=hotel-booking)

