## Comfortable Hotels for Extended Stays

### Ensana Vltava

Ensana Vltava, housed in an Art Nouveau building from 1900, offers excellent value for money — especially for guests planning a longer stay. The hotel has its own treatment centre with the full spectrum of balneology procedures under medical supervision.

- **Own treatment centre** — full balneology under medical supervision
- **Attractive rates** — ideal for longer treatment stays

